#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy. A checkbox; Done is hidden until it is checked.
msgid "recoveryCode.saved"
msgstr "J’ai enregistré mon code de récupération"

#. Your sync key changed
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42).
msgid "ringChange.title"
msgstr "Votre clé de synchronisation a changé"

#. {device} set up a new key for your synced data.
